//! ltx.rs — LTX (Lite Transaction) file reader/writer + CRC64-ISO checksums.
//!
//! Ported from ltx@v0.5.2 `ltx.go`, `checksum.go`, `encoder.go`, `decoder.go`
//! and litestream@v0.5.11 `v3.go`. `reference/ltx-format.md` describes the
